        447.7,
        122.5,
        447.7
      ],
      "text": "The instant revision has been filed by M/s Victor Component Systems Pvt. Ltd. challenging the demand notice dated 27-06-2023 issued by the Respondent Authority, whereby time extension charges have been levied. The Revisionist does not deny that the time extension charges are payable by him. His only prayer is limited to the fact that the time extension charges should be applicable from the outer limit for construction as mentioned in the lease deed. It is a settled position of law that once a binding contract is entered between the parties, one party cannot unilaterally alter the conditions of the contract."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 6,
      "poly": [
        122.5,
        456.1,
        519.5,
        456.1,
        519.5,
        515.1,
        122.5,
        515.1
      ],
      "text": "The Respondent Authority agrees to this contention of the Revisionist. The Revision is disposed of with a direction to the Authority to recalculate the time extension charges as per the conditions mentioned in the lease deed."
    },
